{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.TotallyGeodesicUnconditional","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TotallyGeodesicUnconditional","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.TotallyGeodesicFaces","lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicGeodesicUniqueness"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.hemisphere_isTotallyGeodesic_uncond","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.hemisphere_isTotallyGeodesic_uncond","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TotallyGeodesicUnconditional.lean#L58-L64","doc":"**The corpus hemisphere is totally geodesic — UNCONDITIONALLY.**\n\nThe exact hemispherical face the ideal tetrahedron intersects (`hemisphereE R`,\nany radius `R > 0`) is totally geodesic, with no remaining hypothesis. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.verticalPlane_isTotallyGeodesic_uncond","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.verticalPlane_isTotallyGeodesic_uncond","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TotallyGeodesicUnconditional.lean#L47-L56","doc":"**The corpus vertical plane is totally geodesic — UNCONDITIONALLY.**\n\nThe exact vertical faces the ideal tetrahedron intersects (`verticalPlaneE n d`,\nany unit base normal `n`, any offset `d`) are totally geodesic, with no remaining\nhypothesis: the `[HypMinimizerUnique]` of `verticalPlane_isTotallyGeodesic` is now\ndischarged by `instHypMinimizerUnique`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.instHypMinimizerUnique","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.instHypMinimizerUnique","kind":"instance","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TotallyGeodesicUnconditional.lean#L38-L45","doc":"**The T2 geodesic-uniqueness conjecture, promoted to a global instance.**\n\n`HypMinimizerUnique` is no longer open: `hypMinimizerUnique_derived` is a genuine,\nmachine-verified derivation from WALL-2 + WALL-4. Registering it as an `instance`\nmakes every `[HypMinimizerUnique]`-conditional theorem in the corpus\nunconditional. It is a `Prop` class (proof-irrelevant), so this introduces no\ndiamond. ","signatureChunk":0}]}